09</lpage><year>1984</year></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><label>28</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lagercrantz</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spin trapping of some short-lived radicals by the nitroxide method</article-title><source>J. Phys. Chem.</source><volume>75</volume><fpage>3466</fpage><lpage>3475</lpage><year>1971</year></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><label>29</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Janzen</surname><given-names>E.G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spin trapping</article-title><source>Acc. Chem. Res.</source><volume>4</volume><fpage>31</fpage><lpage>40</lpage><year>1971</year></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><label>30</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Noda</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Anzai</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kohno</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimmei</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Packer</surname><given-names>L.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hydroxyl and superoxide anion radical scavenging activities of natural source antioxidants using the computerized JES-FR 30 ESR spectrometer system</article-title><source>Biochem. Mol. Biol. Int.</source><volume>42</volume><fpage>35</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><year>1997</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9192083</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><label>31</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Noda</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kohno</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Packer</sur